<P STYLE="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">About Dazhou Technician College</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Dazhou Technician College is a leading public vocational institution
in Sichuan Province with decades of experience in technical and skilled workforce education. Serving as a key talent development base
in northeastern Sichuan, the College offers multiple specialized academic clusters aligned with regional industrial priorities and is
committed to cultivating highly skilled professionals to support local economic development.</P>

